[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Ambition</h2>
<i>"It is what drives us to our ultimate goal.  It does takes brains to reach it though."<br>
---Dancol Wisenhol, Nimbian Priest</i>  
<p>After letting the Lord Chamberland use the Isle of Geysers for military gains, you decide to escort him for a short while before heading off to other battles.  Unfourtunatly for you he has brought the Isle into a major battle...into the MIDDLE of it!  You must help the Chamberland defeat these new foes or die with him in battle.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
You wish the Lord Chamberland luck as he takes the Isle of Geysers into enemy territory...you have a feeling that thing may not turn out as planned... 
<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,tnron62a

[ai3TempleDead]
<h2>Message from Lord Chamberland of Thunder</h2>
<p>
We have nothing to worry about, we will win this battle!

[ai6TempleDead]
<h2>Message from Lord Chamberland of Thunder</h2>
<p>
These fools will not defeat me!!  I will crush them!

[ai7TempleDead]
<h2>Message from Lord Chamberland of Thunder</h2>
<p>
Ha hah!  These fools fall before us with ease.


[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
You have died and the Lord Chamberland of Thunder slain as well.  From this battle the clans you attack united and defeated all before them...

